{"za/w": {"key": "za/w", "head": "ζάω", "html": "<b class=\"lsj-head\">ζάω</b>, v. ζῶ."}, "ze/w": {"key": "ze/w", "head": "ζέω", "html": "<b class=\"lsj-head\">ζέω</b>, <span class=\"lsj-gramGrp\"><span class=\"lsj-gram\">contr.</span></span> <span class=\"lsj-per\">3</span> <span class=\"lsj-number\">sg.</span> <span class=\"lsj-greek\">ζεῖ</span> even in <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><i class=\"lsj-title\">Il.</i> 21.362</span>; later <span class=\"lsj-gramGrp\"><span class=\"lsj-gram\">Ep.</span></span> <b class=\"lsj-orth\">ζείω</b> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Call.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Dian.</i> 60</span>, <span class=\"lsj-mood\">subj.</span> <span class=\"lsj-greek\">ζείῃσι</span> Epic. in <i class=\"lsj-title\">Arch.Pap.</i> 7p.7; in late Prose <b class=\"lsj-orth\">ζέννυμι</b> (q.v.): <span class=\"lsj-tns\">impf.</span> <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">ζέε</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><i class=\"lsj-title\">Il.</i> 21.365</span></span>, <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">ἔζεε</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Hes.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Th.</i> 695</span></span>, <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">ἔζει</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">S.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">OC</i> 434</span></span>: <span class=\"lsj-tns\">fut.</span> <span class=\"lsj-greek\">ζέσω </span> (<span class=\"lsj-etym\">ἐξανα-</span>) <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">A.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Pr.</i> 372</span>: <span class=\"lsj-tns\">aor.</span> <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">ἔζεσα</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Hdt.</span> 7.188</span></span>, cf. <span class=\"lsj-greek\">ἐπιζέω</span>; <span class=\"lsj-gramGrp\"><span class=\"lsj-gram\">Ep.</span></span> <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">ζέσσα</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><i class=\"lsj-title\">Il.</i> 18.349</span></span>:—<span class=\"lsj-gramGrp\"><span class=\"lsj-gram\">Pass.</span></span>, <span class=\"lsj-tns\">aor.</span> <span class=\"lsj-greek\">ἐζέσθην </span> (<span class=\"lsj-etym\">ἀπ-</span>) <span class=\"lsj-author\">Dsc.</span> 1.3, (<span class=\"lsj-etym\">ἐν-</span>) <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Aret.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">CA</i> 1.2</span>: <span class=\"lsj-tns\">pf.</span> <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">ἔζεσμαι</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><i class=\"lsj-title\">Gp.</i> 10.54.3</span></span>:—<div class=\"lsj-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><i>boil, seethe,</i> of water, <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">ἐπεὶ δὴ ζέσσεν ὕδωρ ἐνὶ ἤνοπι χαλκῷ</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><i class=\"lsj-title\">Il.</i> 18.349</span></span>, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><i class=\"lsj-title\">Od.</i> 10.360</span>; <span class=\"lsj-greek\">ὡς δὲ λέβης ζεῖ ἔνδον</span> as the kettle <i>boils,</i> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><i class=\"lsj-title\">Il.</i> 21.362</span>, cf. <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">E.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Cyc.</i> 343</span>; rarely of solids, <i>to be fiery hot,</i> <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">χθὼν ἔζεε</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Hes.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Th.</i> 695</span></span>, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\">847</span>; <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">χαλκός</span> <span class=\"lsj-author\">Call.</span></span> l.c. </div><div class=\"lsj-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><b class=\"lsj-sense-n\">2.</b>  <i>ferment,</i> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Hp.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">VM</i> 11</span>; <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">γλεύκους ζέοντος</span> <span class=\"lsj-author\">Dsc.</span> 5.8</span>. </div><div class=\"lsj-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><b class=\"lsj-sense-n\">3.</b>  metaph., <i>boil</i> or <i>bubble up,</i> <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">τῆς θαλάσσης ζεσάσης</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Hdt.</span> 7.188</span></span>; <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">αἷμα διὰ χρωτὸς ζέσσʼ</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><i class=\"lsj-title\">AP</i> 7.208</span></span> (Anyte); <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">οἶνος ζεῖ</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Pl.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Lg.</i> 773d</span></span>. </div><div class=\"lsj-sense\" data-level=\"4\"><b class=\"lsj-sense-n\">b.</b>  of passion, <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">ὁπηνίκʼ ἔζει θυμός</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">S.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">OC</i> 434</span></span>, cf. <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Pl.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">R.</i> 440c</span>, etc.; <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">τὸ ζέον τῆς μάχης</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Hld.</span> 1.33</span></span>. </div><div class=\"lsj-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><b class=\"lsj-sense-n\">4.</b>  c. gen., <i>boil up</i> or <i>over with</i> a thing, <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">λίμνη ζέουσα ὕδατος καὶ πηλοῦ</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Pl.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Phd.</i> 113a</span></span>; <span class=\"lsj-greek\">πίθος ζ. [οἴνου</span>] <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Thphr.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">HP</i> 9.17.3</span>; <span class=\"lsj-greek\">πεδία ζείοντʼ Ἀγαρηνῶν</span> <i>boiling, teeming with</i> . . , <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><i class=\"lsj-title\">APl.</i> 16.39</span> (<span class=\"lsj-author\">Arab.</span>); of persons, <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">ζ. σκωλήκων</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Luc.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Alex.</i> 59</span></span>: c. dat., <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">ζ. φθειρί</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Id.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Sat.</i> 26</span></span>; <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">ζ. φλογμῷ</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Lyc.</span> 690</span></span>; <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">θάλαττα αἵματι καὶ ῥοθίῳ ζέουσα</span> <span class=\"lsj-author\">Aristid.</span> 1.142J.</span> </div><div class=\"lsj-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><b class=\"lsj-sense-n\">II.</b>  causal, <i>make to boil, boil,</i> <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">τοὶ δὲ λοετρὰ πυρὶ ζέον</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">A.R.</span> 3.273</span></span>; <span class=\"lsj-greek\">θυμὸν ἐπὶ Τροίῃ πόσον ἔζεσας</span>; <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><i class=\"lsj-title\">AP</i> 7.385</span> (<span class=\"lsj-author\">Phil.</span>). </div><div class=\"lsj-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><b class=\"lsj-sense-n\">2.</b>  <i>exhale,</i> <span class=\"lsj-greek\">ἀϋτμήν</span> (v.l. -μῇ) <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">A.R.</span> 1.734</span>. (<span class=\"lsj-greek\">ζέ(σ)-ω,</span> cf. <span class=\"lsj-greek\">ζεσ-τός,</span> Skt. <span class=\"lsj-greek\">yásati</span> ‘boil’, OHG. <span class=\"lsj-greek\">jësan</span> ‘ferment’, ‘foam’, Engl. <span class=\"lsj-greek\">yeast.</span>) </div>"}, "zw/i+on": {"key": "zw/i+on", "head": "ζώϊον", "html": "<b class=\"lsj-head\">ζώϊον</b>, <span class=\"lsj-gen\">τό</span>, poet. for <span class=\"lsj-greek\">ζῷον,</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Semon.</span> 13</span>."}, "zw=|on": {"key": "zw=|on", "head": "ζῷον", "html": "<b class=\"lsj-head\">ζῷον</b>, <span class=\"lsj-gen\">τό</span>, <div class=\"lsj-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><i>living being, animal,</i> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Hdt.</span> 5.10</span> (of bees), <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Ar.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">V.</i> 551</span>, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><i class=\"lsj-title\">Pl.</i> 443</span>, etc.; <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">πᾶν ὅ τι περ ἂν μετάσχῃ τοῦ ζῆν ζῷον ἂν λέγοιτο</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Pl.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Ti.</i> 77b</span></span>; <span class=\"lsj-greek\">ζῷα,</span> opp. <span class=\"lsj-greek\">φυτά,</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Id.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Phd.</i> 70d</span>, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\">110e</span>, etc.; <span class=\"lsj-greek\">ζ. θαλάττιον, χερσαῖον,</span> <span class=\"lsj-author\">Phld.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Rh.</i> 1.98S.; contemptuously, <span class=\"lsj-greek\">ὅπως ἡ χώρα τοῦ τοιούτου ζῴου καθαρὰ γίγνηται</span> may be free from this kind of <i>animal</i> (i.e. beggars), <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Pl.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Lg.</i> 936c</span>; <span class=\"lsj-greek\">ζ. πονηρόν,</span> of women, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Secund.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Sent.</i> 8</span>. </div><div class=\"lsj-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><b class=\"lsj-sense-n\">II.</b>  in art, <i>figure, image,</i> not necessarily of animals (cf. <span class=\"lsj-greek\">ζῴδιον</span>) , <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">ζῷον δέ οἱ ἐνῆν, ἀνὴρ ἱππεύς</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Hdt.</span> 3.88</span></span>: mostly in pl., <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">ζῷα ἐς τὴν ἐσθῆτα ἐγγράφειν</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Id.</span> 1.203</span></span>, cf. <span class=\"lsj-bibl\">2.4</span>, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\">124</span>, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\">148</span>, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Pl.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">R.</i> 515a</span>, etc.; <span class=\"lsj-greek\">ζῷα γράψασθαι τὴν ζεῦξιν τοῦ Βοσπόρου</span> to have <i>pictures</i> of the bridging of the Bosporus painted, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Hdt.</span> 4.88</span>; cf. <span class=\"lsj-greek\">ζωγραφέω</span>: <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">ζῷα ποιεῖν</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Plu.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Per.</i> 13</span></span>. </div><div class=\"lsj-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><b class=\"lsj-sense-n\">III.</b>  <i>sign</i> of the Zodiac, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Man.</span> 2.166</span>.—The word is post-<span class=\"lsj-author\">Hom.</span>, no generic word used for <i>animal</i> being found till after the middle of the fifth cent. B.C. (<span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">ζώϊον</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Semon.</span> 13</span></span>, whence <span class=\"lsj-gramGrp\"><span class=\"lsj-gram\">Att.</span></span> <span class=\"lsj-greek\">ζῷον</span> by contraction: <span class=\"lsj-itype\">ι</span> is found in <i class=\"lsj-title\">IG</i> 1(2).372.42, al.,11(2).161<i class=\"lsj-title\">B</i> 76 (<span class=\"lsj-placeName\">Delos</span>, <span class=\"lsj-date\">iii B.C.</span>), <span class=\"lsj-author\">Phld.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Rh.</i> 2.166S., and in codd. opt. in the Noun; the <span class=\"lsj-pos\">Adj.</span> <span class=\"lsj-greek\">ζωός</span> (q.v.) had no <span class=\"lsj-itype\">ι</span>: for the compds. (exc. <span class=\"lsj-greek\">ζωγλύφος, ζωγράφος</span>) decisive evidence is lacking: <span class=\"lsj-greek\">ζῳάγρια</span> with <span class=\"lsj-itype\">ι</span> was read by <span class=\"lsj-author\">Aristarch.</span> in <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><i class=\"lsj-title\">Il.</i> 18.407</span>.)</div>"}, "zwo/tokos": {"key": "zwo/tokos", "head": "ζωοτόκος", "html": "<b class=\"lsj-head\">ζωοτόκος</b>, <span class=\"lsj-itype\">ον</span>, opp. <span class=\"lsj-greek\">ᾠοτόκος,</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Arist.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">HA</i> 489a34</span>, al., <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Ph.</span> 1.502</span>; [<span class=\"lsj-greek\">βόες</span>] <div class=\"lsj-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><i>bringing forth live</i> calves, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Theoc.</span> 25.125</span>. </div><div class=\"lsj-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><b class=\"lsj-sense-n\">2.</b>  <i>life-giving,</i> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Nonn.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">D.</i> 26.191</span>, al.</div>"}, "zw|o/w": {"key": "zw|o/w", "head": "ζῳόω", "html": "<b class=\"lsj-head\">ζῳόω</b>, <div class=\"lsj-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><i>fashion into an animal,</i> <span class=\"lsj-tns\">pf.</span> <span class=\"lsj-mood\">inf.</span> <span class=\"lsj-gramGrp\"><span class=\"lsj-gram\">Pass.</span></span> <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">ἐζῳῶσθαι</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Alex.Aphr.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">in Top.</i> 137.26</span></span>.</div>"}}